  "releaseNotes": "0.2.2: Fix MSB4061/MissingMethodException with TaskHostFactory by packaging LegacyLibAnalyzer.deps.json alongside the task assembly\n            0.2.1: Fix out-of-process execution warning v2\n\t\t\t0.2:\n\t\t\t- Added `Category` option: `Maintainability` (default), `Reliability` or `Security`\n\t\t\t- Renamed `Code` to `ErrorCode`, default to `LegacyLib-Forbidden`\n\t\t\t- Fix out-of-process execution warning\n\t\t\t- .NET 8 support",
